        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86080, Ribbon and Reed Back-To-Back Door Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ribbon and Reed 8 Inch Back-to-Back Pull Set shows off the ever popular French Colonial design. It is this Ribbon and Reed Back-To-Back Door Handle Pair that manages to evoke a feeling of the old world while still feeling current, the perfect finishing touch for any traditional home. This door pull comes packaged as a set of two pulls designed to mount back-to-back on a single door. The Ribbon and Reed Pull will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. Choose from an array of beautiful finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/ribbon-and-reed-8-inch-pull-emtek-86080\"><b>Ribbon and Reed Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek French Colonial Solid Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7-finish.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
